%--------------------------------------------------------------------------
%getDelayLengths
%By: Brielle Ferguson
%Date: 12/1/24
%Will take the trial structure generated by readAnalyzePlotBehData, and
%find the number of delay lengths. See listTrialTypes to perform a similar
%function for any field (e.g., delay length, distractor intensity)
%Inputs:
% - trials: data structure with trial information from a behavioral session
%Outputs:
% - num: how many unique delay lengths there are 
% - vals: the specific values of the delay lengths
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------
function [num,values] = getDelayLengths(trials)
for i = 1:length(trials)
    if ~isempty(trials(i).delayLength)
    delayLength(i) = trials(i).delayLength;
    end
end

values = sort(unique(delayLength),'ascend');
num = length(values); 

end